      "description": "🧾️ `context.resolve` response — mints/refreshes the implicit `AgentSession` for stdio clients (`📋️master.md` §\"AgentSession\"). `scopes` are plain capability-id strings rather than `kernel::CapabilityId` — this crate has zero dependency on the kernel crate (§2.6 of this packet's brief), so the newtype cannot be named here.",
